  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "21879440",
      "title": "Understanding CSS Animations",
      "lectureOrder": 195,
      "videoOrder": 170,
      "sourceHash": "9f933fdc7e0adb0d4161d09291de26c661549150e8c202a367996cf8251b217c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 4.45,
          "en": "Besides the transition property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.45,
          "end": 6.31,
          "en": "which we can use to tell CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.31,
          "end": 9.72,
          "en": "to well provide a transition between two changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.72,
          "end": 13.34,
          "en": "we can also set up a more detailed animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.34,
          "end": 18.34,
          "en": "For that we first of all have to define an animation in CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.71,
          "end": 20.94,
          "en": "And we do this by writing @keyframes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.07,
          "end": 24.07,
          "en": "and then any name of our choice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.07,
          "end": 26.92,
          "en": "for example, slide-fade",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.92,
          "end": 29.55,
          "en": "but again, this name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.55,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "Now, in here you can define in detail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.94,
          "end": 35.08,
          "en": "how the animation should behave,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.08,
          "end": 37.41,
          "en": "and which different states it should have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.41,
          "end": 40.61,
          "en": "and you express this with percentages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.61,
          "end": 45.61,
          "en": "You for example say that at 0% of animation completion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.04,
          "end": 48.8,
          "en": "so at the start you for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.8,
          "end": 53.41,
          "en": "want to have transformation along the X axis of zero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.41,
          "end": 55.3,
          "en": "so it hasn't been moved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.3,
          "end": 59.39,
          "en": "And in addition, you set the scale to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.39,
          "end": 64,
          "en": "Scale is a number transform function which you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64,
          "end": 65.843,
          "en": "to change the size of a block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.2,
          "end": 70.51,
          "en": "Then let's say after",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.51,
          "end": 73.9,
          "en": "70% of the animation time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.9,
          "end": 76.11,
          "en": "you want to change this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.11,
          "end": 79.81,
          "en": "to move it to 120 pixels to the left",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.81,
          "end": 82.19,
          "en": "and scale it up a little bit,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.19,
          "end": 86.03999999999999,
          "en": "make it 10% bigger by setting the scale to one dot one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.03999999999999,
          "end": 87.78,
          "en": "one is the original scale,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.78,
          "end": 89.813,
          "en": "one dot one is 10% bigger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.35,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "And then here at 100%,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 97.85,
          "en": "we want to translate X to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.85,
          "end": 100.56,
          "en": "the full minus 150 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.56,
          "end": 103.47,
          "en": "So move it the entire way to the left",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.47,
          "end": 105.43,
          "en": "and set scale back to one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.43,
          "end": 107.53,
          "en": "So that we just bump up the size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.53,
          "end": 110.25999999999999,
          "en": "in the middle or a little bit after the middle",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.25999999999999,
          "end": 113.53,
          "en": "of the animation and move it almost",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.53,
          "end": 115.81,
          "en": "to the end here at this point and entirely",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.81,
          "end": 119.17,
          "en": "to the end here and bring it back to its normal size.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.17,
          "end": 122.15,
          "en": "And these are different states we have in our animation now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.15,
          "end": 124.47,
          "en": "that's now our defined animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.47,
          "end": 127.82,
          "en": "and the different states the so called keyframes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 127.82,
          "end": 130.28,
          "en": "wanna reach during that animation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.28,
          "end": 132.41,
          "en": "And we now apply this by going",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.41,
          "end": 134.83,
          "en": "to our block first of all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.83,
          "end": 136.44,
          "en": "and removing transition there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.44,
          "end": 140.26,
          "en": "We can move transition and animation together if we want to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.26,
          "end": 142.833,
          "en": "but often you'll use just one of the two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 143.71,
          "end": 145.05,
          "en": "So here I want to use an animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 145.05,
          "end": 147.13,
          "en": "hence I comment out transition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 147.13,
          "end": 149.9,
          "en": "And in the class which we add eventually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.9,
          "end": 151.81,
          "en": "I'll comment out transform,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 151.81,
          "end": 155.82,
          "en": "and instead add the animation CSS property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.82,
          "end": 159.65,
          "en": "That property now allows us to add an animation when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.65,
          "end": 162.363,
          "en": "that CSS class is added to an element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 163.54,
          "end": 166.88,
          "en": "Here, we now refer to one of our keyframe sets,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.88,
          "end": 169.96,
          "en": "which we defined so in this case at slide-fade.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 169.96,
          "end": 172.48,
          "en": "So using this name here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.48,
          "end": 174.82999999999998,
          "en": "then we still specify a duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 174.82999999999998,
          "end": 178.27,
          "en": "which will be split up across these key frames.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.27,
          "end": 181.24,
          "en": "So here, let's say dot three seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 181.24,
          "end": 183.12,
          "en": "And also easing function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 183.12,
          "end": 185.52,
          "en": "which controls how fast these different states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 185.52,
          "end": 188.71,
          "en": "are reached if we start fast and end slow,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 188.71,
          "end": 190.913,
          "en": "or if we start slow and end fast.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 193.02,
          "end": 195.77,
          "en": "If we save all of that, and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.77,
          "end": 197.53,
          "en": "if I click animate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 197.53,
          "end": 199.13,
          "en": "you see it animates,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 199.13,
          "end": 202.21,
          "en": "but then it snaps back to the original state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 202.21,
          "end": 203.22,
          "en": "That's not a bug",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 203.22,
          "end": 206.41,
          "en": "that's how CSS animations behave by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 206.41,
          "end": 209.97,
          "en": "we need to add four words here to tell CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 209.97,
          "end": 213.93,
          "en": "that we want to keep the final keyframe the final state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 213.93,
          "end": 218.74,
          "en": "as the new look the new state of the animated element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 218.74,
          "end": 222.32999999999998,
          "en": "So by adding four words here, if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 222.32999999999998,
          "end": 223.6,
          "en": "if I click animate,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 223.6,
          "end": 227.07,
          "en": "it now moves over there with our custom animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 227.07,
          "end": 229.31,
          "en": "and keeps that final state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 229.31,
          "end": 231.88,
          "en": "And that's how we can implement animations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.88,
          "end": 235.89,
          "en": "with CSS transitions or CSS animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 235.89,
          "end": 238.52,
          "en": "And all we're doing with view here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 238.52,
          "end": 242.37,
          "en": "is we're adding this animate class dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 242.37,
          "end": 245.09,
          "en": "two to two be animated element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 245.09,
          "end": 247.33,
          "en": "which of course also doesn't have to be a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 247.33,
          "end": 248.76,
          "en": "but could be anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 248.76,
          "end": 252.31,
          "en": "And often that is all you need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 252.31,
          "end": 256.13,
          "en": "But there also is a scenario where this is not enough.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.13,
          "end": 258.133,
          "en": "So let's explore that, next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
